<title>SPAIN: Spain's June jobless rate fell to 22.04 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's June jobless rate fell to 22.04 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute (INE) gave the following figures:</p>
<p> UNEMPLOYMENT			JUNE '96   MAY '96  JUN '95</p>
<p> Total unemployed (mln)	    3.5	 N.A.	N.A.</p>
<p> Pct of workforce (pct)	   22.04     22.27     22.56</p>
<p>NOTE - Data based on INE survey of households (EPA). The labour ministry publishes separate unemployment figures based on registered unemployed.</p>
</text>
